public/og/

# Local terminal recordings (demo gif/webm) — deliberately kept out of the repo.
# A recording freezes a point-in-time state and then goes stale in silence: every
# other figure on this site is live from the KV, and the freshness guard only
# checks text, never pixels. Archive them outside the repo instead.
recordings/
